{"heroId":67,"art":{"card":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/bookworm_card.webp","background":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/backgrounds/patience_bg.webp","vertical":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/bookworm_vertical.webp"},"text":{"en":{"role":"","playstyle":"","lore":"The daughter of a rare book dealer, Paige grew up in a loving home that prioritized kindness, magic, and storytelling.  But while Paige took naturally to her parents' values, her little brother Bryce did not.\n\nA rebellious teen, Bryce resented not only his family’s saccharine attitude, but also their refusal to let him dabble in magics that they deemed too dangerous.  Paige tried everything she could think of to keep him out of trouble, but like most teenagers, the more his big sister tried to tell him what was best for him, the more he turned away.\n\nPaige doesn't know what Bryce did to get kicked out of the house...just that she came home from the library to find her brother gone and her parents crying.\n\nDays turned to weeks, to months, to years.  Paige grew to become a talented bibliomancer, making a living as a storyteller reading at libraries across the five boroughs; and while her parents have remained silent about what happened with Bryce, Paige's obsession with finding him has only grown.  She will discover what happened to her brother... and no man or god is going to stand in her way.","tags":["Helpful","Protector","Booksmart"]},"es":{"role":"","playstyle":"","lore":"Hija de un librero especializado en obras raras, Paige creció en un hogar lleno de cariño en el que se daba prioridad a la bondad, la magia y el arte de contar historias. Pero mientras Paige adoptó con naturalidad los valores de sus padres, con su hermano pequeño, Bryce, no fue así.\n\nComo adolescente rebelde, a Bryce le molestaba no solo la actitud empalagosa de su familia, sino también su negativa a dejarle experimentar con magias que consideraban demasiado peligrosas. Paige hizo todo lo que se le ocurrió para evitar que se metiera en problemas, pero, como la mayoría de los adolescentes, cuanto más intentaba su hermana mayor decirle lo que era mejor para él, más se alejaba.\n\nPaige nunca supo qué hizo Bryce para que lo echaran de casa... solo que volvió un día de la biblioteca y encontró a su hermano desaparecido y a sus padres llorando.\n\nLos días se convirtieron en semanas, las semanas en meses y los meses en años. Paige llegó a convertirse en una talentosa bibliomante, ganándose la vida como narradora en bibliotecas de los cinco distritos. Y, aunque sus padres han permanecido en silencio sobre lo ocurrido con Bryce, la obsesión de Paige por encontrarlo no ha hecho más que aumentar. Descubrirá qué le sucedió a su hermano... y no dejará que ni dioses ni mortales se interpongan en su camino.","tags":["Atenta","Protectora","Leída"]}},"abilities":{"en":[{"id":604448162,"slot":1,"ultimate":false,"name":"Bookwyrm","img":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/bookworm/bookworm_dragon.webp","quip":[],"sections":[{"text":[{"t":"Conjure a dragon that appears at the target location before flying forward, dealing "},{"t":"spirit damage","attr":"SpiritDamage","icon":"attr_SpiritDamage"},{"t":" and leaving a burning path in its trail."}],"groups":[{"stats":[{"label":"Damage","value":"60","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/damage_magic_color.svg"},{"label":"Damage Per Second","value":"30","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/damage_magic_color.svg"},{"label":"Trail Duration","value":"3.0","unit":"s","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/duration.svg"}]}],"basics":[{"label":"Dragon Travel Range","value":"20m","unit":"","icon":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/range.svg"}]}],"cooldown":{"label":"Cooldown","value":"33